Core Requirement

They want the ability to take one credit card transaction (e.g., $200) and split it across multiple categories or clients (e.g., $100 + $100). [CC App Bac...Recording | Video]
Today, the app does NOT support this, so users:

Put instructions in the notes
Then Sarah manually adjusts it after upload [CC App Bac...Recording | Video]



Proposed Approach

A potential solution discussed:

Split the single transaction into multiple rows (transactions) before upload
Example: turn $200 into two $100 entries, each categorized correctly [CC App Bac...Recording | Video]



Key Considerations / Challenges

Upload compatibility:

The approach depends on what the Business Importer tool supports [CC App Bac...Recording | Video]


Traceability / reconciliation:

If a $200 transaction becomes two $100 entries:

The system needs a way to flag or track that they originated from one transaction
Otherwise, reconciliation could be confusing because the original $200 never exists in the uploaded data [CC App Bac...Recording | Video]





